  "articleBody": "A living room addition can create more seating, improve daylight, and connect indoor space to a patio or yard, but the right plan depends on lot constraints, structural conditions, utilities, energy requirements, and the intended use. Begin with a measured assessment, define the scope, and compare complete design-and-construction proposals before signing.",
